<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 15.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1500 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Dec 98.00/97.50</p>
<p>Norfolk Jan/Mar 98.00 Apr/Jun 100.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Apr/Jun 100.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Nov 97.00 Jan/Mar 100.00 Apr/Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Staffordshire Jan/Mar 98.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Sep (97) 95.50 Oct/Dec (97) 98.50</p>
<p>East Anglia Nov 96.00 Dec 97.00 Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
<p>Avon Nov 95.50 Dec 97.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Liverpool Nov 98.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 98.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Jan/Mar 99.50</p>
</text>
